  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given Equation: **312 – 13 × 14 + 207 ÷ 4 = 539\n\n**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each Option One by One:\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and –**\n\nGiven: 312 – 13 × 14 + 207 ÷ 4 = 539\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n__**312 ÷13**__ × 14 + 207 - 4 = 539\n\n__**24 × 14**__ + 207 - 4 = 539\n\n__**336 + 207**__ - 4 = 539\n\n__**543 - 4**__ = 539\n\n**539 = 539.**\n\nOption 2) – and +\n\nGiven: 312 – 13 × 14 + 207 ÷ 4 = 539\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n312 + 13 × 14 - __**207 ÷ 4**__ = 539\n\n312 + __**13 × 14**__ - 51.75 = 539\n\n__**312 + 182**__ - 51.75 = 539\n\n__**494 - 51.75**__ = 539\n\n442.25 ≠ 539.\n\nOption 3) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: 312 – 13 × 14 + 207 ÷ 4 = 539\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n312 – 13 × __**14 ÷ 207**__ + 4 = 539\n\n312 – __**13 × 0.06**__ + 4 = 539\n\n__**312**__ - 0.87 __**+ 4**__ = 539\n\n__**316 - 0.87**__ = 539\n\n315.13 ≠ 539.\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\nGiven: 312 – 13 × 14 + 207 ÷ 4 = 539\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n312 – 13 + 14 × __**207 ÷ 4**__ = 539\n\n312 – 13 + __**14 × 51.75**__ = 539\n\n__**312**__ – 13 __**+ 724.5**__ = 539\n\n__**1036.5 – 13**__ = 539\n\n1023.5 ≠ 539.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 1'.***",
